# Generated data artifacts. data/raw/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the DILIrank
# workbook is 110KB of US-government public-domain data, and committing it pins
# the exact dataset version a result was produced from. DILIrank 2.0 reclassified
# 49 drugs from 1.0, so "which version" is part of the result.
data/out/

